          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઢળવું — ḍhaḷvũ — \"to lean towards; to slip down\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આખી ચર્ચા પછી મારો મત તમારી બાજુ ઢળે છે. ākhī carcā pachī māro mat tamārī bāju ḍhaḷe che. After the whole discussion my view leans your way."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): તે દીવાલ એક બાજુ ઢળી ગઈ, te dīvāl ek bāju ḍhaḷī gaī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઢળવું (ḍhaḷvũ) is inherited from ḍhalati, \"bends over, falls\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; CDIAL glosses the Gujarati verb \"to slip, to be poured out\" (CDIAL 5581). Leaning towards an opinion is a later sense."
            }
          ]
        },
